  "description": "*“Heroes of the Nine Great Gates of the Nation---!!”*\n\nRising with righteous fury against the nation's peril, Nungunbi, the Suncheon Gate Master and leader of the Nine Great Gates faction. But betrayed by the Eight Generals he trusted, the nation fell and he slipped into a coma... \n\nTen years later, he miraculously awoke, only to hear news of the traitors living in luxury. \n\n *“A gentleman's revenge is never too late, even after ten years.”*\n\nNungunbi's fury, as heavy as the weight of time itself, now demands retribution!\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
